  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>此资源包需要 </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animatica\" rel=\"nofollow\">Animatica</a>（可选）</strong></p>\n<p>在 Drodi 的灾厄村民和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fresh Animations</strong></a> 之间难以抉择？现在无需再纠结了！</p>\n<p><strong>Drodi 的灾厄村民 x Fresh Animations</strong> 是专为 <strong>Fresh Animations</strong> 制作的兼容补丁，让您能够同时拥有两个资源包的所有功能。</p>\n<p>为了使其正常工作，您需要下载：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Drodi 的灾厄村民 x Fresh Animations</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fresh Animations</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>在资源包列表中，请将 Fresh Animations 放在 Drodi 的灾厄村民 x Fresh Animations 下方，否则将无法正常工作！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1182131/description_a9ec2112-1dc3-45c7-b182-e66e4432c730.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"203\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>我的资源包的官方版本可在 Curseforge 上通过用户 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dordinatteur/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dordinatteur</a>、Planet Minecraft 上的用户&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fdrodi%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Drodi</a> 以及 Modrinth 上的用户 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fDrodi\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Drodi</a> 找到。其他来源可能包含病毒或恶意软件，因此如果您想从其他网站下载，请自行承担风险。</p>\n<p>如果您认为有人在其他来源重新上传了我的资源包且可以采取行动，请通过 Discord 联系我（用户名：drodi99）。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>感谢 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFreshLX\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh LX</a> 允许我将此兼容补丁上传至 Curseforge。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fkemiu%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Keniu</a> 与 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252frustillery%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rustillery</a>：他们的资源包《<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fillagers-reborn-1-15%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Illagers Reborn</a>》和《<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252frustillery-s-classy-illagers%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rustillery's Classy Illagers</a>》分别提供了灵感。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252freijvi%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reijvi</a>：为整体风格提供灵感。其资源包《<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fminecraft-reimagined-5096190%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reimagined</a>》中的多种配色方案被再次使用，包括皮革和铁。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
